{%- comment -%}
  Promo & Grow — PDP star badge (decision-moment social proof)

  Drops Judge.me's preview-badge container right under the title/price.
  Judge.me's already-loaded storefront JS scans for .jdgm-preview-badge
  and fills it with the product's average stars + review count, linking
  down to the full reviews widget already rendered lower on the page.

  If a product has no reviews, Judge.me renders nothing here — safe.
  Wrapped so we can style spacing without touching Judge.me internals.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="png-pdp-stars">
  <div class="jdgm-widget jdgm-preview-badge"
       data-id="{{ product.id }}"
       data-template="product"></div>
</div>
